  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">STDF 2009-2013 - Standards and Trade Development Facility 2009-2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">STDF 2009-2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Standards and Trade Development Facility (STDF) &#xe4;r ett gemensamt      initiativ kring kapacitetsbyggande och tekniskt samarbete inom        SPS-omr&#xe5;det. STDF syftar till &#xf6;kad koordinering i leveransen av       SPS-relaterat bist&#xe5;nd. STDF bidrar ocks&#xe5; med projektfinansiering.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Standards and Trade Development Facility (STDF) is a joint        initiative in capacity building and technical cooperation aiming at   raising awareness on the importance of sanitary and phytosanitary     (SPS) issues, increasing coordination in the provision of SPS-related assistance, and mobilizing resources to assist developing countries   enhance their capacity to meet SPS standards.</narrative>
  </description>
